<li data-section-id=3D"8y70be" data-start=3D"946" data-end=3D"993">
<p data-start=3D"948" data-end=3D"993">UI, logging, storage, and host commu=
nications</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"995" data-end=3D"1481">That matches how ST positions its U=
