<p data-start=3D"6453" data-end=3D"6492">Add the external PA only when you =
need:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"6494" data-end=3D"6589">
<li data-section-id=3D"qmxrso" data-start=3D"6494" data-end=3D"6513">
<p data-start=3D"6496" data-end=3D"6513">longer read range</p>
