<p data-start=3D"6837" data-end=3D"6941">If your goal is <strong data-start=
=3D"6853" data-end=3D"6892">to learn and prove protocol control</strong>, s=
tart with <strong data-start=3D"6905" data-end=3D"6940">STM32 + reader IC +=
