<p data-start=3D"6943" data-end=3D"7007">If your goal is <strong data-start=
=3D"6959" data-end=3D"6996">to build something like HX-R01B-9</strong>, pla=
n for:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"7009" data-end=3D"7131">
<li data-section-id=3D"1aa3uhw" data-start=3D"7009" data-end=3D"7022">
<p data-start=3D"7011" data-end=3D"7022">external PA</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"ggsola" data-start=3D"7023" data-end=3D"7051">
<p data-start=3D"7025" data-end=3D"7051">better antenna engineering</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"1vuq4cj" data-start=3D"7052" data-end=3D"7074">
<p data-start=3D"7054" data-end=3D"7074">carrier cancellation</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"xi33wf" data-start=3D"7075" data-end=3D"7096">
<p data-start=3D"7077" data-end=3D"7096">EMI/regulatory work</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"15s71jt" data-start=3D"7097" data-end=3D"7131">
<p data-start=3D"7099" data-end=3D"7131">enclosure and thermal validation</=
p>
