<h1 data-section-id=3D"17punl5" data-start=3D"8178" data-end=3D"8201">6) FW=
D Power Detector</h1>
<p data-start=3D"8203" data-end=3D"8619">The forward-power detector monitor=
s how much transmit RF power is actually flowing in the forward direction. =
In ST=E2=80=99s design, the sampled TX power from the 20 dB coupler is furt=
her attenuated and then fed into a <strong data-start=3D"8414" data-end=3D"=
