an <strong data-start=3D"8481" data-end=3D"8494">ADC input</strong> of the =
microcontroller. ST names <strong data-start=3D"8528" data-end=3D"8542">MAX=
4003EUA</strong> as the power detector on that board. <span class=3D"" data=
