<h3 data-section-id=3D"11dkagn" data-start=3D"8621" data-end=3D"8650">What =
it does electrically</h3>
<p data-start=3D"8651" data-end=3D"8782">The detector converts RF amplitude=
 or power into a DC voltage. That voltage can be measured by the MCU to est=
imate actual TX power.</p>
<h3 data-section-id=3D"wgwuyd" data-start=3D"8784" data-end=3D"8802">Why it=
 matters</h3>
<p data-start=3D"8803" data-end=3D"8822">This is useful for:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"8823" data-end=3D"8970">
<li data-section-id=3D"1b4lw9t" data-start=3D"8823" data-end=3D"8847">
