<h3 data-section-id=3D"11dkagn" data-start=3D"14771" data-end=3D"14800">Wha=
t it does electrically</h3>
<p data-start=3D"14801" data-end=3D"14901">It synthesizes an RF cancellatio=
n vector that reduces the residual carrier leaking into the RX path.</p>
<h3 data-section-id=3D"wgwuyd" data-start=3D"14903" data-end=3D"14921">Why =
it matters</h3>
<p data-start=3D"14922" data-end=3D"15111">This is one of the main reasons =
a reader can remain sensitive while transmitting a much stronger carrier ne=
arby. Without good cancellation, the RX chain loses dynamic range and sensi=
tivity.</p>
